# Copy the variables required by the concrete project into this file.
# Never put tokens, passwords or raw credential contents here.
# Prefer *_FILE variables that point to a protected file outside Git.

# PROJECT_ENV=development
# PROJECT_CREDENTIAL_FILE=/protected/path/credential

# Reference checks (.agents/scripts/check-reference-*.py) read only these keys.
# Preferred: link the canonical checkout's .project/credentials/.env to the
# device's shared credential file (llm-credentials); worktrees reach it through
# their .project/credentials link, and the checks export only these keys from it.
# Fallback: write them in this project's ignored .env, which accepts no other
# key and wins over the shared file; exported values win over both.
# The contact address joins the metadata services' polite pools; the API keys
# are optional. Never write real values here.
# BIBTEX_CHECK_MAILTO=you@example.org
# OPENALEX_API_KEY=
# S2_API_KEY=
